== Trivia ==
* Despite being called the Burning Basement, the backdrop of the floor is actually based on the {{s|Cellar}}, looking more reddish and with a burning element added to it.

== Music ==
* The [[music]] that plays in the Burning Basement is titled ''Fundamentum''.<ref>[https://ridiculon.bandcamp.com/album/the-binding-of-isaac-afterbirth-ost Binding of Isaac: Afterbirth OST]</ref>
** ''Fundamentum'' is Latin for "Foundation".
** The song's melody is similar to that of ''Diptera Sonata'', the theme for the [[Basement]].

